<title>USA: First Bancshares sets share buyback.</title>
<headline>First Bancshares sets share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN GROVE, Mo. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Bancshares Inc said Friday it plans to begin a stock repurchase program, effective December 23, to acquire up to 120,625 shars, or about 10 percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The repurchase program is expected to be completed within one year.  </p>
<p>After a year, the company will reevaluate the program and decide whether to terminate or continue it.</p>
<p>First Bancshares is parent of First Home Savings Bank.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
